{"title":"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Fast_calculation)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Fast calculation)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the tens digit in the sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/2/bc23705486fc49308e04b5b5505b0bb2463bcb41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7!+8!+9!+...+2006!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"186\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc18e4cd0250c23ada5cb910be1d8c43f4cd752.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 1\\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 3\\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 4\\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 6\\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"355\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/2/c824ea490ff073932a1c17d8ce0b9a4215f90d95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10!$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, any <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Factorial\" title=\"Factorial\">factorial</a> greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/2/c824ea490ff073932a1c17d8ce0b9a4215f90d95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10!$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> is also divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. The last two <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Digit\" title=\"Digit\">digits</a> of all factorials greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/2/c824ea490ff073932a1c17d8ce0b9a4215f90d95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10!$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/f/b1f2c746327924273ba209f0879ea846a0b8dd6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$00$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, so the last two digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/d/14d3f16d533036ac71a6e8a1dbe968f49bc6eb3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10!+11!+...+2006!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"168\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/f/b1f2c746327924273ba209f0879ea846a0b8dd6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$00$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />. \n(*)\n</p><p>So all that is needed is the tens digit of the sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/d/ffdb57a47ef31a1832edac4171282e89717560ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7!+8!+9!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/b/a8bad5c6f48c8e464639619c6e7c5d88d3e389b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7!+8!+9!=5040+40320+362880=408240$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"373\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>So the tens digit is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/9/fa9073850b901d86aa525ea6586176619fc33fad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>(*) A slightly faster method would be to take the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/0/0807d278db612869d21715b131a86b9bb74544d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\pmod {100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"88\" height=\"18\" /> residue of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/9/9396c3aac08fb3ab1c124ee973cba2c5f2f06574.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7! + 8! + 9!.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"90\" height=\"14\" /> Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/f/c7fa027eb0424ff984903cb27635bb754605b491.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7! = 5040,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"78\" height=\"16\" /> we can rewrite the sum as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/e/1de56c07aa4efc6f508d9d71c952d4b824f74e02.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5040 + 8\\cdot 5040 + 72\\cdot 5040 \\equiv 40 + 8\\cdot 40 + 72\\cdot 40 = 40 + 320 + 2880 \\equiv 40 \\pmod{100}.\\]\" width=\"599\" height=\"18\" /> Since the last two digits of the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, the tens digit is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/9/fa9073850b901d86aa525ea6586176619fc33fad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"57\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Fast_calculation.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Fast_calculation)\">Solution 1 (Fast calculation)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Fast calculation)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To find the tens digit, we need to work in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/f/71f5d626af41e799f48d1043aabde03003cfa77a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bmod \\, 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/6/446248d4012fc8fcf5b355358e4cecc79497ebf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 \\mid n!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4fb56731fc96b93a31e993b9ea89c11bd2897a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/1/2d1e2211955d84633b61e3187c4c26eb19b1cdb0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7!+8!+9!+\\cdots+2006! \\equiv 7!+8!+9! \\pmod{100}\\]\" width=\"403\" height=\"18\" /> Now, we simplify the expression by factoring, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/6/0a6e29e9199bd0c162318b31969711364d4c6d15.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7!+8!+9! \\equiv 7!(1+8+9\\cdot8) \\equiv7!\\cdot81 \\pmod{100}\\]\" width=\"401\" height=\"18\" /> We won't explicitly calculate the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/1/ce11f9bca5e74ba532323e045b62e2793d120b7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7!$\" width=\"12\" height=\"13\" /> but rather we will rewrite it as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/5/9c50133c6ff6c150abe7ac83bb8b307ca456169c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7!=7\\cdot6\\cdot5\\cdot4\\cdot3\\cdot2\\cdot1=42\\cdot120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"265\" height=\"14\" />. Now we will use this to our advantage to calculate the modulo quickly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b39349d4c65a6c683236e02e74e5ac7321d066.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[7!\\cdot81 \\equiv 42 \\cdot 20 \\cdot 81 \\equiv 40 \\cdot 81 \\equiv 40 \\pmod{100}\\]\" width=\"364\" height=\"18\" />\nTherefore the tens digit is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/5/4856511d3870bacfc75de2abba2d943ff057f202.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(\\textbf{C}) \\, 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"53\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~ <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/b/abbaa2d63b4b0621e038e82904fb55f2b59eadbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{N}\\text{oo}\\vec{\\text{r}}\\,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"15\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B\">2006 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2006 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017132135\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 245/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2324/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5488/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.558      1 -total\n 60.67%    7.619      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 38.34%    4.814      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2888:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017132135 and revision id 293088. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}